<title>SINGAPORE: Teledata 1996 net profit up 36.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Teledata 1996 net profit up 36.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31, 1996</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   4.50    vs	3.30</p>
<p>    Dividend (pct)		    12.00    vs     12.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		  5.63    vs	4.13</p>
<p>    Turnover			    83.69    vs     55.13</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest    0.07    vs	0.06</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		 0.50    vs	0.21</p>
<p>    Depreciation (expense)	   0.61    vs	0.51</p>
<p>    Profits from associates	  0.41    vs	0.32</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		     5.91    vs	4.15</p>
<p>    Tax				    1.75    vs	1.35</p>
<p>    Minorities	    (loss)     0.07    vs	0.18 (gain)</p>
<p>Note - Teledata (Singapore) Ltd is a unit of Teledata Communications.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
</text>
